   ],
   "label": "Passes in flight",
   "doc": "How many consecutive whole prompt passes run at once when the stagger is on: 2 (the pair) or 3 (a third pass on a third Rocinante lane). Measured on the four Sparks (a cold ~147K-token prompt): no gain at 3 (6,433 tok/s against 6,491-6,507 at 2, inside the noise), compute time a pass +2.7 % (three streams co-running stretch every kernel; idle unchanged at 39.7 ms), and about 5.5 GiB less free memory a Spark: keep 2. Needs TF_DS_ROCI_STAGGER=1 and passes of at most 10,240 rows; a Spark under the memory floor refuses 3 by name. Replies unchanged.",
