   "doc": "Gate/up writes the expert pack's FP8 codes and scales into the transport's send region itself, so the separate quantizing launch does not run (about 5 to 6 ms a 4,096-row pass, estimated, not measured). Needs TF_DS_MMA_SF_EXACT (not beside TF_DS_GEMM_R2 or TF_DS_GEMM_W16) and the pack as codes; where a rank cannot run it the start says why and gate/up and the quantizing launch run as before, on every rank. Replies unchanged by contract.",
